#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Logging-and-logger-configuration.rst:47
msgid ""
"The following code will output a log message from a ROS 2 node at ``INFO`` "
"severity, but only the first time it is hit:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Logging-and-logger-configuration.rst:53
msgid ""
"// printf style\n"
"RCLCPP_INFO_ONCE(node->get_logger(), \"My log message %d\", 4);\n"
